@prefix eco:<https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#>. @prefix skos:<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>.
eco:TypedFailureClassification a eco:GovernanceInvariant,skos:Concept;skos:prefLabel "typed failure classification";skos:definition "Failed transitions are preserved as typed evidence instead of being collapsed into generic failure.";eco:falsifier "Discarding the failed transition class falsifies this invariant.".
